{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DM4pgLCOLt1793614832.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產九龍豪宅又一村達之路分行分行經理廖志豪表示，分行最新促成1宗何文田朗賢峯租賃成交，單位為6A座中層C室，實用面積497平方呎，採兩房一廁間隔，設開放式廚房，單位座向東方，望內園景，最新以28000元租出，折合實用呎租56元。</p><p> </p><p>據悉，上址業主2024年4月以約1103萬元購入單位，持貨2年半，是次租出單位可享3厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:17.001519+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T23:38:09.815030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:21.760629+00:00","content_hash":"7381e86af1469b68eaf1d5829169b1c499263231d065170c5a4e5685d76fcc4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:17.001519+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}